# docs/ is working material (plans, reviews, comms drafts, evidence, sweep notes) and stays local.
# Only the allowlist below is tracked: the files the README, the scripts and the scheduled
# upstream check read. Add a new tracked doc here deliberately; never `git add docs`.
docs/**
